x743 puts x741 x742
x744 call close x743 
x745 write x744 2
x746 text "e0 fn clamp u32 u32 u32 -> u32\nlo lt p0 p1\nhi lt p2 p0\na select lo p1 p0\nr select hi p2 a\nret r\n\n"
x747 puts x745 x746
x748 call open x747 6
