x759 puts x757 x758
x760 call close x759 
x761 call close x760 
x762 call close x761 
x763 call open x762 13
x764 write x763 4
x765 write x764 1
x766 text "diagnostics"
x767 puts x765 x766
x768 call open x767 11
x769 write x768 2
x770 text "Diagnostics"
x771 puts x769 x770
x772 call close x771 
x773 call open x772 2
x774 write x773 2
x775 text "Every rejection carries a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision, limit), what was expected, what was seen, and the one fix that resolves it. The compiler never guesses: a reply that is ambiguous is rejected with the fix, not applied approximately."
x776 puts x774 x775
x777 call close x776 
x778 call close x777 
ret x778
end

