x59 text ".reveal.in #r1 .ty{animation:r1 9600ms linear infinite}.reveal.in #r1::after{animation:r1c 9600ms steps(1,end) infinite}\n.reveal.in .stamp{animation:stamp 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in .stamp i::after{animation:ring 9600ms cubic-bezier(.1,.6,.3,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v3 #v3t{animation:v3 9600ms linear infinite,oldl 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v4 #v4t{animation:v4 9600ms linear infinite,oldl 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v3n,.reveal.in #v4n{animation:newl 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v3{animation:mark 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v4{animation:mark2 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in #a0{animation:a0 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in #a1{animation:a1 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in #a2{animation:a2 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n"
